te those stated in the question.\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{∂D}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & =-{∮}_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{∮}_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r-{∮}_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r \\\\  & =-\\left(- \\frac{7}{2}\\right)+\\left(- \\frac{14}{3}\\right)-\\frac{20}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{-(-21)+(-28)-40}{6} \\\\  & =- \\frac{47}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186543910 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d962943-db75-5bbc-9aa3-6b784b3c37c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2(8\\cdot\\left(\\csc \\theta\\right))" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543907} {:answer/id #uuid "2c20249b-7432-5b5b-93c8-728d6bf3ab6a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-(8\\cdot\\left(\\csc \\theta\\right))" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543916} {:answer/id #uuid "3b93c5df-fd4d-5d4e-9532-11976ee37256" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8\\cdot\\left(\\sin \\theta\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543922} {:answer/id #uuid "6bfda229-e5b8-545c-9faf-e2cbe587225e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(8\\cdot\\left(\\csc \\theta\\right))\\sin \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543928} {:answer/id #uuid "b10e20d3-6bdd-5022-adac-000f3f9a5a8a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8\\cdot\\left(\\csc \\theta\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543949}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b10e20d3-6bdd-5022-adac-000f3f9a5a8a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8\\cdot\\left(\\csc \\theta\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543949} :answer-field/id #uuid "a66b7693-ae70-5ca8-8834-90bf330d9869" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543944}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "1ac95360-72b0-51df-b6d9-cee9ca946f4f" :question/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{8\\cdot\\left(\\sin^{2} \\theta\\right)+8\\cdot\\left(\\cos^{2} \\theta\\right)}{\\sin \\theta}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor the numerator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{8\\cdot\\left(\\sin^{2} \\theta\\right)+8\\cdot\\left(\\cos^{2} \\theta\\right)}{\\sin \\theta}=\\frac{8\\cdot(\\sin^{2} \\theta+\\cos^{2} \\theta)}{\\sin \\theta}\n$$\n\nNext, we use the Pythagorean identity to rewrite the expression in the parentheses, and then we simplify the resulting expression as much as possible.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{8\\cdot(\\sin^{2} \\theta+\\cos^{2} \\theta)}{\\sin \\theta} & =\\frac{8\\cdot 1}{\\sin \\theta} \\\\ & =\\frac{8}{\\sin \\theta} \\\\ & =8\\cdot\\left(\\csc \\theta\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{8\\cdot\\left(\\sin^{2} \\theta\\right)+8\\cdot\\left(\\cos^{2} \\theta\\right)}{\\sin \\theta}=8\\cdot\\left(\\csc \\theta\\right).\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186543932 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3135498e-a921-59bf-a166-f1f511e8735b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10\\cdot\\left(\\csc \\phi\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543919} {:answer/id #uuid "6e6f7a50-e00d-5a3e-9b4c-fb224bff356a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(10\\cdot\\left(\\csc \\phi\\right))\\sin \\phi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543929} {:answer/id #uuid "72a153a2-9202-5eda-acba-924df0ec8e14" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2(10\\cdot\\left(\\csc \\phi\\right))" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543930} {:answer/id #uuid "86000318-aad3-56b0-8386-0d3b405d570c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/mat