ity to rewrite the expression in the parentheses, and then we simplify the resulting expression as much as possible.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{9\\cdot(\\sin^{2} t+\\cos^{2} t)}{\\sin t} & =\\frac{9\\cdot 1}{\\sin t} \\\\ & =\\frac{9}{\\sin t} \\\\ & =9\\cdot\\left(\\csc t\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{9\\cdot\\left(\\sin^{2} t\\right)+9\\cdot\\left(\\cos^{2} t\\right)}{\\sin t}=9\\cdot\\left(\\csc t\\right).\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186543942 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b87f662b-0cb1-5cec-b920-e74a5d00fc15" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2(2\\cdot\\left(\\sec \\phi\\right))" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543950} {:answer/id #uuid "c956e3db-8d0b-55b3-829d-654518a95e10" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\cdot\\left(\\sec \\phi\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543953} {:answer/id #uuid "de1169eb-d022-576b-8a26-1a3931e93dae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-(2\\cdot\\left(\\sec \\phi\\right))" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543956} {:answer/id #uuid "f08e57fd-0c1f-5127-8553-36e79db1760a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\cdot\\left(\\cos \\phi\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543957} {:answer/id #uuid "f7b0f7d7-f559-5f30-a10b-48237d53156e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2\\cdot\\left(\\sec \\phi\\right))\\cos \\phi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543960}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c956e3db-8d0b-55b3-829d-654518a95e10" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\cdot\\left(\\sec \\phi\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543953} :answer-field/id #uuid "c49aabc2-88d3-50e7-8d23-71eac5133330" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218604